# LocalFinance - Claude Configuration File

## Project Overview
**Project:** LocalFinance - Privacy-First Personal Finance Assistant
**Purpose:** Complete local finance management system for Jetson devices
**Privacy Model:** 100% local processing, no cloud dependencies
**Target Hardware:** NVIDIA Jetson Orin Nano (primary), Raspberry Pi (secondary)

## Repository Structure

### Core Components
```
localfinance/
├── dashboard/               # Web interface components
│   ├── app.py              # Main Flask application (20KB)
│   ├── enhanced_web_upload.py # Modern drag & drop interface
│   ├── web_upload.py       # Basic web interface
│   └── README.md           # Dashboard documentation
├── production/             # Production deployment
│   ├── scripts/
│   │   ├── installer.sh    # Complete automated installer
│   │   └── manage.sh       # Service management
│   ├── services/           # SystemD service files
│   └── README.md           # Production deployment guide
├── src/                    # Original framework (prototype)
│   ├── ai/                 # AI inference modules
│   ├── bot/                # Bot framework
│   └── core/               # Core functionality
├── enhanced_hisab_bot.py   # Working Telegram bot with AI
├── document_processor.py   # File monitoring system
└── simple_hisab_bot.py     # Lightweight bot for testing
```

## Technology Stack

### Backend
- **Language:** Python 3.8+
- **Framework:** Flask (web interface)
- **Database:** SQLite (local privacy)
- **AI Model:** Ollama with llama3.2:1b (local inference)
- **File Processing:** PDFplumber, Pandas
- **Bot Framework:** python-telegram-bot

### Infrastructure
- **Services:** SystemD (auto-start/restart)
- **Process Management:** Background services
- **File Monitoring:** Watchdog
- **Deployment:** Bash scripts, automated installers

### Dependencies
```
python-telegram-bot==20.7
flask==3.1.3
pdfplumber==0.10.3
pandas==2.1.4
watchdog==4.0.0
requests==2.31.0
sqlite3 (built-in)
```

